menu "e32p: wdt"

    config E32P_WDT_ENABLE
        bool "Enable e32p_wdt (task watchdog)"
        default n
        help
            Facade over the ESP-IDF Task Watchdog Timer: configure timeout/panic,
            subscribe the current task, and feed it. Idempotent init that adopts
            a system-started TWDT via reconfigure.

endmenu
